oneOf.description:
Filesystem cleanup the operator still has to do by hand. Set
when `force=true` deleted a store whose data dir is non-empty;
the server intentionally never `rm -rf`s secret material.

writable.description:
Whether the wrapper may write to this resource through the
secretsd channel. Applies to the `files` and `libsecret` slots;
`env` has no wrapper-side write path. Defaults to `false`.
